    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent. He chose to complete a psychiatric advance directive: if another episode begins, he wants to be told plainly what is happening, to be treated close to home if he needs admission, to have aripiprazole rather than a medicine that made him restless, and to have his paints brought to him. He named a health care agent, recorded in the confidential part of the chart and not named here. He chose not to record other treatment preferences today. The directive will be revisited yearly or after any episode. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
